# Route Handlers (API)

## External API (`/api/v1/*`)

- Auth: `isValidApiKey(request)` — header `x-api-key` or `Bearer`.
- Validate body with the same Zod schema as Server Actions (`application/schemas`).
- Call use cases from `@/modules/<m>` — no business logic in the route.
- Errors: `errorResponse(error, { route, method })` from `@/common/adapters/http/error-response`.
- Metrics: wrap handlers with `withRouteMetrics(method, route, fn)` when adding routes.

## Probes & observability

- `GET /api/health` — liveness (no DB).
- `GET /api/ready` — readiness (`select 1`).
- `GET /api/metrics` — Prometheus scrape (internal only in prod).

## Auth routes

`app/auth/callback/` — Supabase OAuth/PKCE callback; login logic lives in Server Actions.
